623335", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MvhR7Mn0JpEQ7kNvwEI0i-_&_nc_oc=Adp7ecdJKla0xF5DFvjNzkoJS-500rtp5xlxwecuuab0nXRmkfvFRHp6JzPCijVEYaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCftR4MCB7VKX-pZjVxrIb9gm0p1dCSj9TMPOMmQD9YoQ&oe=6A5395E2"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cGScwHU9dGwQ7kNvwGRRKgh&_nc_oc=AdowrjKRboB8C1yVgC7vA_HUsnbIl1YcdehX1g375x6CTDOczN3TSyf-KU0QfMNGqL8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAQ4yPeadiH0vA9R44DThKDy9xzvROjWjWOBLLGS4y3aw&oe=6A53A373"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gRjyxviy14kQ7kNvwHyjYbH&_nc_oc=AdofLCHxGnRuVxLlronV59dcTkU_N4NKkKFykkmlbsVR3TQBbGHs9dyLJfnK-l2AcRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAwlO9eXf-uKtY2PFHAVj0SQXh6p2GKOqQozCNFPLkc5g&oe=6A5397EB"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJXrLNP8eqsQ7kNvwEgdZaT&_nc_oc=AdqVJYAxl7S-A5z0hCYXo4CNt-fNVRkivaiuoX7QadWv7LAHeK0UZNR8L2tPdHAZFTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBr3hnpffsHH4Sr18aqzZWBfNnnzh11e3mqjyqeTuwmcw&oe=6A537CE2"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RoGOl1KHuz0Q7kNvwF7Hj95&_nc_oc=Adq_p2I9biUv2OJxr1SA_xYxt1ZVrgQ3F9cSBX7DoRpwM7uXm35vDklUF4QErBMmxjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBBImyEkAvXGYHctrovkEDbvc--agsCRs1_c_ojhHJXXg&oe=6A537F7D"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292